      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is already possible with third-party tooling (\"stalker lite\") on Windows, but those tools request log-in information from users which may be against the VRChat Creator Guidelines at this moment.\n\nMay be nice to implement natively in VRChat, as I know many people use external tooling for this purpose.",
